00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.170
A-Asahi!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.130
Yeah?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.580
Um...

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:56.290
When we collided this morning,
well, something...

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.290
Oh! That's right!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.130
I have it.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.170
