00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.960
If you don't mind that it's been in my pocket.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:50.880
Oh, and it's a little beat-up
because someone smacked it.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.630
In your pocket?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.920
You mean...

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.040
It's fine if you don't want it.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.960
I do! I want it.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:07.830
Here.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.000
Thanks.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.420
It's yummy!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.080
Right? Welp, I'll go find something else.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.040
See ya.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.250
U-um...

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.130
Thank you.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.670
<b>My Banana Is 6 Inches</b>

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.380
I'll have to make do with this.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.080
Help me!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.130
No. Don't tell me...

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:39.880
Please help me!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.420
Please! You have to help me!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.080
No. There's nothing I can do.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.000
I'm begging you!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:56.080
Hey! Cut it out and stop chasing this guy!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.630
Thank you.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.670
Sure.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.880
And...

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:28.210
I'm sorry for being so rude after
I dragged you into my mess this morning.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.420
That's okay.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.130
To make up for it,
be more careful from now on.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.880
Do you... forgive me?

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.130
Yeah.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.630
Thank you very much.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:39.580
In any case...

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.330
Let's both forget this happened today.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.750
Let's just say a stray dog attacked me.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:51.250
Speaking of which... you did get bitten.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.670
Ow...

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.830
That damn mutt.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.130
Mr. Kashiwagi.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.630
See you later, ma'am.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.710
Did you hurt your elbow?

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.630
