00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.790
Whatever.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.790
I'll see to you, so come this way.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.460
Ow!

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:22.130
