00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:27.170
I'm glad you're living an active life,
but don't forget to be careful.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:28.670
I won't.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.420
And about this morning...

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.290
Sorry. I jumped to the wrong conclusion.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.540
I must have been leaning on you, right?

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.790
You didn't deserve that treatment.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:44.500
It's fine. As long as you know now.

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.750
You're so kind.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.420
