00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.170
Anything I can help with?

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.540
N-no, I'm fine.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.290
I can handle it on my own.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:03.710
Really? Then I'll get going now.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.040
Oh, okay.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.710
You're making a lecherous face.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.380
No, I'm not.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.630
Anyway, where are the adhesive bandages?

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.330
What's wrong? Did you cut yourself?

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.000
None of your business.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.500
If you want, I'll stick it on you.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.630
F-forget it! I'll do it myself!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.880
Don't be shy. Show me the cut.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.290
