00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.580
G-give that back!

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.170
Y-you got it all wrong! I just picked it up for you!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.290
I know, okay?

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.920
