00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.630
Huh?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.830
That's all!

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:27.330
I can finally go home.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.080
That was one weird day.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.330
Well? Did you clear up the misunderstandings?

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.500
